Jacob feels the same way
about technology as you do.

28:33.963 --> 28:36.633
Once I open this door,
there's no turning back.

28:39.844 --> 28:42.013
Are you sure this is what you want?

28:50.313 --> 28:51.898
So be it.

28:57.362 --> 28:59.238
I'm here with John Locke.

29:00.239 --> 29:02.617
We're coming in now.

29:25.139 --> 29:27.475
Jacob...

29:28.685 --> 29:30.228
This is John.

29:32.313 --> 29:34.649
Aren't you going to say hello, John?

29:37.235 --> 29:41.739
What? — I told you he wouldn't.

29:41.823 --> 29:44.409
Who... what are you talking about?

29:45.576 --> 29:47.578
