33:06.444 --> 33:11.574
What did you hear in there, John?
What did Jacob say to you?

33:13.701 --> 33:18.831
He didn't say anything to me. You did.
— what are you talking about?

33:18.915 --> 33:21.083
There is no Jacob, Ben.

33:21.167 --> 33:25.379
I'm not gonna be taken in by the
little... show you put on last night.

33:25.463 --> 33:29.634
You're a fraud. And it's time
your people were told the truth.

33:31.135 --> 33:33.804
And this is not the way we came.

33:35.014 --> 33:39.602
I'm taking us back another way.
I wanted to show you something first.

33:39.685 --> 33:42.104
I've seen enough.

33:42.188 --> 33:43.814
You know, John, you're not wrong.

33:43.898 --> 33:46.067
Some of the things I've told you...

33:46.150 --> 33:49.528
Some of the things I've told
everybody... are simply not true.

33:51.322 --> 33:55.409
Well, for starters,
I wasn't born on this island.

33:56.535 --> 33:58.287
Then where did you come from?

34:00.957 --> 34:02.541
That's what I want to show you.

34:53.801 --> 34:55.678
Morning.

34:55.761 --> 35:00.433
Ok, wait. Put it right...
Right down there.

35:02.393 --> 35:03.811
What's your problem now?

35:04.520 --> 35:07.148
You're usually chatty Cathy
in the morning.

35:07.231 --> 35:08.607
It's my birthday.

35:12.653 --> 35:15.323
I don't know why I keep
fooling myself into thinking

35:15.406 --> 35:18.492
that one of these years
you're actually going to remember.

35:21.329 --> 35:23.372
Well, I'll tell you what,

35:23.456 --> 35:28.836
all we gotta do this morning
is run this stuff out to Pearl station.

35:28.919 --> 35:32.923
Why don't we go up to the mesa,
drink some beers?

35:35.760 --> 35:40.973
Have some... I don't know,
father and son time?

35:43.934 --> 35:48.147
- I'd like that. — ok.

35:49.732 --> 35:51.734
[Radio plays rock music]

36:02.328 --> 36:04.330
[Roger] Well...

36:05.539 --> 36:08.084
You sure can't say
it ain't beautiful.

36:20.971 --> 36:22.890
Do you really blame me?

36:26.185 --> 36:29.146
Do you really think
it's my fault that she died?

36:40.157 --> 36:43.828
Why do you keep looking at your watch?
You got a date?

36:44.787 --> 36:45.788
Listen...

36:48.249 --> 36:52.044
If it makes you feel any better...

36:52.128 --> 36:56.424
I will do my best
to remember your birthday next year.

36:59.510 --> 37:02.513
I don't think that's gonna happen, dad.

37:04.265 --> 37:05.766
What do you mean?

37:05.850 --> 37:10.688
You know, I've missed her too.
Maybe as much as you have.

37:10.771 --> 37:14.942
But the difference is,
that for as long as I can remember,

37:15.025 --> 37:17.445
I've had to put up with you.

37:19.530 --> 37:25.286
And doing that required
a tremendous amount of Patience.

37:32.001 --> 37:34.378
Goodbye, dad.

37:38.966 --> 37:42.344
[Canister whistling]

39:55.936 --> 40:00.149
You want us to, um...
Go get his body?

40:04.320 --> 40:06.030
No, leave him out there.

40:29.053 --> 40:31.555
[Ben] This is where I came from, John.

40:34.767 --> 40:40.564
These are my people.
The Dharma initiative.

40:42.274 --> 40:45.402
They came here seeking Harmony.

40:47.571 --> 40:51.950
But they couldn't even coexist
with the island's original inhabitants.

40:54.411 --> 40:57.998
When it became clear
that one side had to go.

40:58.082 --> 41:01.835
One side had to be purged.

41:06.924 --> 41:10.803
I was one of the people that was smart
enough to make sure that I didn't end up

41:10.886 --> 41:12.513
.u/ I,

41:12.596 --> 41:16.475
which makes me considerably
smarter than you, John.

41:20.771 --> 41:23.065
[Moaning]

41:30.280 --> 41:31.824
What did Jacob say to you?

41:31.907 --> 41:33.701
Why did you do this?

41:33.784 --> 41:37.287
Because you heard him.

41:38.455 --> 41:40.833
Now, I need to know what he said.

41:40.916 --> 41:42.376
Help me.

41:42.793 --> 41:47.214
John, I'm not going to ask you again.

41:47.297 --> 41:49.758
What did he say to you?

41:51.552 --> 41:55.848
He said, "help me."

42:06.775 --> 42:10.779
Well, I certainly hope
he helps you, John.
